msgctxt "108"
msgid "What do you say? Willing to go now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "I..."
msgstr "Io..."

msgctxt "132"
msgid "I remember now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "156"
msgid "I remember now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Don't tell me getting knocked around like that actually\r\n"
"jogged your memory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"I think it did! Hey, aren't you Kazuma Kiryu of the Dojima\r\n"
"Family!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "You know who I am?"
msgstr "Sai chi sono io?"

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Wow. No way! This really takes me back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"We fought outside a theater once and you kicked the crap\r\n"
"outta me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Really? Sorry, I don't remember."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "Nah, don't worry about it! Thanks to you, my memory's back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"...Hey, I remember even more now! There was this big fight\r\n"
"in my family, and I took a real bad blow to the head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Don't mean to rain on your parade, but it's time for you to\r\n"
"talk about the Reapers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Will you agree to go to the HLA?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Sure. Why not? I've got my memory back now, so I can tell\r\n"
"them anyth⑬ Hey, wait a minute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Why did I join the Reapers again...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Uh-oh. Don't tell me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"What was the name of the Reapers' boss? I think it\r\n"
"started with an \"A\"... Or maybe not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"So your memory's back, but you still can't remember\r\n"
"anything important?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"It would appear that way, yes... Hmm... I just\r\n"
"can't remember..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "(I'll let the HLA sort this out.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Hey, what're you doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Aaagh! Don't sneak up on people like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "I'm not in the mood to talk. Just leave me alone, will ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "You're Akitsu, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "How do you know my name!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"The Honest Living Association sent me to track down a group\r\n"
"of hitmen called the Reapers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "They've got some questions for you. Come with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "Y... You've come to take me away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "That's about the size of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"I don't remember anything... I know I've been working as\r\n"
"a hitman, but I had no other choice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "What do you mean, no other choice?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"All I could remember was my name and how to take a life.\r\n"
"There was no other way I could make a living."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "C'mon, you gotta cut me some slack!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"Losing your memory is no excuse for taking people's lives\r\n"
"for money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "I just... I don't know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"And the fact that you already knew how to kill means you\r\n"
"must've been working as a hitman even before you lost your\r\n"
"memory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"In any case, you can tell them all about it at the Honest\r\n"
"Living Association."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "No way! I don't wanna get caught!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Why should I do what you say!? Just leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

